# =============================================================================
# checkout_engine.py — API-Less Shopify Checkout Engine (v2.5.0)
# =============================================================================
# Direct Shopify checkout automation. No external API server needed.
# Uses curl_cffi for TLS fingerprint spoofing (required to bypass bot detection).
#
# v2.5.0 (from v2.4.1):
#   - ⭐ PORTED FROM WORKING Autoshopify.py — uses /checkouts/unstable/graphql
#     (raw GraphQL POST) instead of /checkouts/internal/graphql/persisted
#     (persisted query IDs, which Shopify changed and broke for us)
#   - cart add uses /cart/add.js (form-encoded, matching Autoshopify)
#   - checkout via POST /checkout/ (matching Autoshopify)
#   - session token extracted from multiple fallback patterns
#   - build_id / source_token / identification_signature handled
#   - 2 attempts on Proposal step (matching Autoshopify)
#   - Full QUERY_PROPOSAL / MUTATION_SUBMIT / QUERY_POLL embedded
#   - Payment token via checkout.pci.shopifyinc.com/sessions
#   - Poll up to 4 times with 4s gap on WaitingReceipt/ProcessingReceipt
#   - Receipt handling: ProcessedReceipt → Charged, FailedReceipt → extract code,
#     ActionRequiredReceipt → 3DS/OTP, ProcessingReceipt → poll more
#   - is_proxy_alive exported for bot integration
#   - Split TTL for proxy health cache (live 5min, dead 1min)
#   - currency + receipt_url surfaced in the public dict wrapper
#
# v2.4.1:
#   - extract_poll_for_receipt_id: 14 regexes + ultimate ±500-char fallback scan
#   - Shopify 429 rate limit: 15-20s backoff, 4 attempts instead of 3
#   - Default SHOPIFY_CONCURRENCY lowered to 4 to avoid /products.json 429
#   - is_proxy_alive exported cleanly for external use (bot integration)
#   - Stronger proxy 407 / dead proxy classification
#   - Split TTL for proxy health cache (live 5min, dead 1min)
# =============================================================================

